01:17:07.518 --> 01:17:10.515
So the reason it's called 13 sentinels

01:17:10.515 --> 01:17:15.515
is because you have, basically
you have 13 main characters.

01:17:15.645 --> 01:17:20.070
And so the way this story
unfolds is that you are able to

01:17:20.070 --> 01:17:24.049
select a perspective of
part of this main character.

01:17:24.049 --> 01:17:29.049
And the basis of this is at
some point in the future,

01:17:29.157 --> 01:17:32.913
Kaiju come along and try
to destroy the world.

01:17:32.913 --> 01:17:36.342
