01:24:13.024 --> 01:24:14.278
- Why, why so?

01:24:14.278 --> 01:24:17.414
- It's because it's, for a lot of people,

01:24:17.414 --> 01:24:20.628
like high school is kind of
seen as like this basically

01:24:20.628 --> 01:24:22.429
like golden time.

01:24:22.429 --> 01:24:24.525
- It's depressing.

01:24:24.525 --> 01:24:27.004
- It's like for a lot of
people, high school is like,

01:24:27.004 --> 01:24:29.637
the whole thing of like in
the west of like high school

01:24:29.637 --> 01:24:33.015
is usually movies that are
based in high school in the west

01:24:33.015 --> 01:24:35.373
are based off bad memories.

01:24:35.373 --> 01:24:38.110
Being like, oh man, my high
school sucked, blah, blah, blah.

01:24:38.110 --> 01:24:39.966
There were all these people,
the jocks, the bullies,

01:24:39.966 --> 01:24:40.799
blah, blah, blah.

01:24:40.799 --> 01:24:43.188
That's the norm in the west, in Japan,

01:24:43.188 --> 01:24:45.589
it's glorified because to a lot of people,

01:24:45.589 --> 01:24:47.840
high school was really fun time

01:24:47.840 --> 01:24:49.480
with friends they'll never get back

01:24:49.480 --> 01:24:52.789
and because it's also the
last years of that person

01:24:52.789 --> 01:24:54.786
being young and free.

01:24:54.786 --> 01:24:56.306
- I mean, I liked high
school, but I wouldn't say--

01:24:56.306 --> 01:24:57.226
- I liked high school.

01:24:57.226 --> 01:24:58.059
- How my life.

01:24:58.059 --> 01:24:58.892
- Yeah, yeah, exactly.

01:24:58.892 --> 01:25:00.805
- I think as well, in terms
of like a storytelling,

01:25:00.805 --> 01:25:04.685
